</td>
<td>
<div align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">to acquire producing and non-producing oil and gas properties with development potential, and to enhance the value of our properties through drilling and other</font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline"> </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">development activities;</font></font></div>
</td>
</tr></table>
</div>

