<td>
<div align="left">
<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">to make distributions to our partners</font>;</font></div>
</div>
</td>
</tr></table>
