<td>
<div align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">after five to seven years following the termination of this offering, to engage in a liquidity transaction in which we will sell our properties and distribute the net sales proceeds to our partners, merge with another entity or list our common units on a national securities exchange; and</font></div>
