<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: symbol, serif; DISPLAY: inline">&#183;</font></div>
</td>
<td>
<div align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">to enable our common unitholders to invest in oil and gas properties in a tax efficient manner.</font></div>
