<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">All distributions made after Payout, which may include all or a portion of the proceeds of the sale of all or substantially all of our assets, will be made as follows:</font></div>

