</td>
<td>
<div align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">First, 35% to the holders of the incentive distribution rights, 35% to the holders of the class B units and 30% to the dealer manager under the dealer manager agreement as its contingent, incentive fee until the dealer manager receives fees equal to 4% of the gross proceeds of the offering of common units; and then</font></div>
</td>
