</td>
<td>
<div align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">neither our Partnership Agreement nor any other agreement requires </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">affiliates of our general partner</font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline"> to pursue a business strategy that favors us or to refer any business opportunity to us;</font></font></div>
