<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">approved by the vote of a majority of the common units (excluding common units owned by the general partner and its affiliates),</font></div>
