<div style="DISPLAY: block; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><br>
</div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Following the initial closing, purchasers will be sold common units at one or more closings. Following the sale of the minimum offering, additional closings will be held monthly during the offering period as orders are received. The final closing will be held shortly after the termination of the offering period or, if earlier, upon the sale of all the common units. It is expected that after the initial closing of the sale of the minimum offering, purchasers will be sold common units no later than the last day of the calendar month following the month in which their orders are received. Funds received during the offering but after the initial disbursement of funds from escrow will be held in purchasers&#8217; accounts with David Lerner Associates, Inc. until the next closing, and then disbursed to us.</font></div>

<div style="DISPLAY: block; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><br>
</div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Each of the four owners of our general partner have agreed to purchase 5,000 common units for $20.00 per common unit ($400,000 total) on the earlier of the date on which 5,263,158 common units are sold or the final termination date.&#160;&#160;</font></div>
</div>
</div>

