<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-STYLE: italic; DISPLAY: inline">Transition Services</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Upon termination of the Management Agreement, the Manager has agreed to cooperate with us in the transition of its management services to a new manager appointed by us by turning over our books and records and other relevant information, if applicable, assigning to us all of its rights under subcontracts and other contractual arrangements entered into by the Manager in connection with the performance of its services, and facilitating the transfer of well operations and the management of our assets to the new manager.</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-STYLE: italic; DISPLAY: inline">Indemnification</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">The Manager will be liable to us for losses incurred by us in connection with its services under the Management Agreement if its performance of, or failure to perform, services under the Management Agreement constitutes gross negligence or intentional misconduct.&#160;&#160;We will be liable to the Manager for losses incurred by it in connection with performing its services under the Management Agreement unless such losses results from the gross negligence or intentional misconduct of the Manager.</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt" align="justify"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="justify"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-STYLE: italic; DISPLAY: inline">Competing and Other Activities</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">The Management Agreement does not restrict the ability of the Manager or its affiliates from competing with us.&#160;&#160;Affiliates of the Manager have acquired properties in the Southern Wolfcamp area of the Central Permian Basin in West Texas, the Utica Shale and liquids rich portion of the Marcellus areas in Ohio, Pennsylvania and West Virginia, the Oklahoma Woodford Shale area of Central Northern Oklahoma<font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">, properties in the continental United States that consist exclusively of properties that will not be operated by the Manager or any of its affiliates and own and are developing gathering systems in certain of those areas</font> and we anticipate that affiliates of the Manager will acquire additional oil and gas properties.&#160;&#160;In addition, entities controlled by Mr. McClendon own interests in, or have the right to acquire interests in, oil and gas properties pursuant to the Chesapeake Energy Founders Well Participation Program.&#160;&#160;Further, an affiliate of the Manager has agreed to provide services similar to those the Manager will provide to us, including the identification and acquisition of oil and gas properties, to another oil and gas investment program. Investments by the Manager and its affiliates in the oil and gas business and provision of management services to competing oil and gas investment programs is permitted by the Management Agreement and will not violate any duty that the Manager owes to us.</font></font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#160;</font></div>

<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt" align="left">&#160;</div>

<div id="PGBRK" style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt">
