<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">require the expenditure of significant amounts in connection with worker health and safety.</font></div>
</td>
</tr></table>
