<div style="DISPLAY: block; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt"><br>
</div>

<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">&#8226;</font>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">First, 100% to the holders of the Units for Preferred Distributions (as defined below) for the most recently completed month;</font></font></div>

<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">&#8226;</font>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">Second, 100% to the holders of Units until any accrued Preferred Distributions for prior months have been made;</font></font></div>

<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">&#8226;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Third, 100% to the holders of Units until an amount equal to $20.00 is distributed per outstanding Unit;</font></div>

<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-WEIGHT: bold; DISPLAY: inline">&#8226;</font>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Fourth, 35% to the holders of the Incentive Distribution Rights and 35% to the holders of the class B units and 30% to the holders of the Dealer Manager Incentive Rights, until the holder of the Dealer Manager Incentive Rights receives an amount equal to 5% of the gross proceeds received by the Partnership from the sale of Units; and</font> </font></div>

<div style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; DISPLAY: inline">&#8226;</font>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">Thereafter, any remaining available distributions will be made</font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline"> 35% to the </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">General Partner</font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline"> Incentive Distribution Rights, 35% to the holders of </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">the </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">class B units and 30% to the holders of </font><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; DISPLAY: inline">Units.</font></font></div>

