<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Offering costs will be deferred and recorded as deferred offering costs until the commencement of the Partnership&#8217;s offering.&#160;&#160;Upon commencement of the Partnership&#8217;s offering these costs will be recorded as a reduction to Partners&#8217; equity.</font></div>

