<div style="MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt" align="left"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; DISPLAY: inline">Prior to &#8220;Payout,&#8221; which is defined below, all of the distributions made by the Partnership, if any, will be paid to the holders of Units.&#160;&#160;Accordingly, the Partnership will not make any distributions with respect to the Incentive Distribution Rights or with respect to class B units and will not make the contingent, incentive payments to the Managing Dealer, until Payout occurs.</font></div>
